			"Message": "style(Worker): Compact ESBuild configuration by removing blank-line separators\n\nRestore dense, compact formatting to the ESBuild configuration object by removing the blank-line separators between each export property, statement, and control-flow block. The previous formatting pass over-expanded the file with vertical whitespace between every property in the export default object, the switch arms, and the async setup callback.\n\nThis condenses the configuration back to a tight layout where related properties and statements are grouped without intervening blank lines, matching the conventional ESBuild config style where config entries are dense and whitespace is used sparingly for semantic grouping rather than per-property separation.",
